  "body": "Elevated, light-filled and beautifully considered, this exceptional freehold residence combines architectural pedigree with generous proportions and an enviable Eastern Bays lifestyle. Designed by architects Cook Sargesson, this home makes a lasting impression with its striking double-height entrance, vaulted ceilings and thoughtfully conceived layout, creating a sense of space that is both impressive and inviting.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the classic, spacious kitchen connects seamlessly with the open-plan dining and living areas, creating a welcoming hub for everyday family life and effortless entertaining. For more intimate evenings or relaxed family time, a separate lounge or family room, complete with a gas fire, offers a cosy retreat through the cooler months. Thoughtfully arranged, the living spaces extend naturally to a low-maintenance outdoor area, creating an easy connection between indoors and out and providing a relaxed setting for entertaining or unwinding.\r\n\r\nFour spacious bedrooms are complemented by a dedicated upper-level study, offering a practical and private workspace for today's flexible lifestyles. Spacious bathrooms, generous wardrobes and excellent storage reflect the attention given to everyday comfort and functionality. With plentiful off-street parking and an easy-care setting, this is a home designed to make daily living that much better.\r\n\r\nBeyond the front door, the appeal of Kohimarama awaits. Kohimarama Beach and Madills Reserve are close at hand, inviting you to enjoy morning walks, ocean swims and time outdoors, while the cafes and waterfront villages along Tamaki Drive add to the relaxed coastal atmosphere. Whether catching up with friends over coffee or enjoying a weekend stroll by the sea, this is a lifestyle to savour.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the proximity to St Thomas School and Selwyn College, while convenient transport options and access to the city add further appeal to this sought-after address. Combining the pedigree of Cook Sargesson design with generous living, versatile spaces and a coveted coastal location at sought-after Kohimarama, this is an opportunity to secure a home with enduring appeal.\r\n\r\nCome to our open home or arrange your inspection and discover the possibilities for yourself.",
